url: "https://vaoxr.modavis.org"
abstract: >-
  An installable web application for exploring a historic positive organ
  through its VAO-linked 3D model, recordings, sampled stops, and performance
  animation. Includes markerless mobile augmented reality, Meta Quest 3
  passthrough, experimental hand-playing, controller scale and light controls,
  and opt-in offline sample packs. Implements a reader for VAO Standard 0.5.0.
keywords:
  - Virtual Acoustic Object
  - musical instrument
  - digital organology
  - WebXR
  - augmented reality
  - Meta Quest
  - Web Audio
  - progressive web application
